      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Brassage Génétique\n\n## Concepts clés"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f67802",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Brassage Inter\n- Prophase I\n- Échange entre chromosomes homologues\n- Crossing-over"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f67803",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Brassage Intra\n- Métaphase I\n- Distribution indépendante des chromosomes\n- Multiplication des combinaisons"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f67804",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Méiose\n- 2 divisions\n- 4 cellules haploïdes\n- Réduction chromatique"
    },
    {
